Source: model-router's --ref argument, which dispatch passes from the operator's own task ref (src/dispatch/cli.ts:502-503) after requiring it to be an existing regular file (src/dispatch/cli.ts:1254-1257). Sink: openSync of that path (bin/model-router.mjs:76). The router reads at most 4 KiB of it as the documented task excerpt for the classifier (bin/model-router.mjs:77-84), while dispatch already delivers the whole ref body to the worker (src/session/worker-sandbox.ts:327, 335-339). The router runs as the operator, so no privilege boundary is crossed and no data reaches anyone the operator did not already send it to. Verdict: false-positive.
